Hence, the following:
ORDER i) The appeal is partly allowed;
ii) The total compensation awarded by the Tribunal is modified and petitioner is entitled to enhanced compensation of Rs.1,25,720/-(Rupees One Lakh Twenty Five Thousand Seven Hundred and Twenty only) over and above what has been already awarded by the Tribunal along with interest at the rate of 6% per annum from the date of filing of the petition before the Tribunal till the date of realization.

